# Two 50x12 note frames, drawn at 2x: approaching, then struck.
#
# Aqua approaching and pink on the hit, which are near-complements. That is the
# largest change the screen can make in one frame, and in a game judged in tens
# of milliseconds the player reacts to the flip before reading anything — see
# the palette header.
name rhythm-notes
size 100 12
key o outline
key A neon-aqua-0
key B neon-aqua-1
key C neon-aqua-2-glow
key P neon-pink-0
key Q neon-pink-1
key R neon-pink-2-glow
pixels
